      "message": "Thanks, `p3s_perf_mmap_size()` looks right to me: 4KB and 8KB data rings fail the `vma_size` check, and `user_extra` stays data + 1 kernel pages, which matches `perf_mmap_close()`.",
      "parentUuid": "4b9d865a_949c2e5e",
